window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Find my magic. Be the best. Beat the odds.</b></p> <p><b>I survived the Obsidian Order's first series of trials. I stopped a madman from putting a massive crater in the middle of New York City. Good job, Seline, but that was only the beginning.</b></p> <p>As I take on my silver trials, friends become competition, competitors turn ruthless, and I still can't touch my magic without it nearly killing me every time I do. If I don't win these trials I'll get left behind, and I've been promised that won't be good for me.</p> <p>If that weren't enough, the infuriatingly sexy Draven asks me to accompany him on a mission to retrieve an item of incredible magical power. Naturally, I saddle up and go with him, hoping at the very least to get a few extra credit points on my trials. But what I encounter is bigger than trials or Orders, and could mean the death of us all.</p> <p><b>Contains mature themes.</b></p>"; 
